# 统一换行策略，避免"整个文件都变了"这种无意义 diff。
# 仓库内一律 LF；Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF 便于记事本编辑。
* text=auto

*.java text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jks binary
*.crt binary
*.jar binary
